subproblem.statement:
For all N, n ∈ ℕ, every U ⊆ ℝ^N, every n-varifold V on U (no further hypothesis), every x ∈ ℝ^N and every real ρ:
normalDefect V x (B_ρ(x) ∖ B_σ(x)) → normalDefect V x (B_ρ(x)) in [0,∞] as σ → 0 with σ > 0 (along the filter 𝓝[>] 0 on ℝ).
Here:
- B_s(x) = closedBall x s;
- normalDefect V x A = ∫_{A×G(N,n)} ofReal(|(y − x) − p_S(y − x)|²/|y − x|^{n+2}) dV(y,S), i.e. the lintegral over A ×ˢ univ with respect to V.measure, where p_S = Grassmannian.project S;
- the integrand is 0 at y = x, by Lean's convention a/0 = 0.
